== Outcome ==

In the eleventh month of the sixty-first year of Kangxi's reign (1722), the [[Kangxi Emperor]] died, and [[Yinzhen]] acceded to the throne as the [[Yongzheng Emperor]].<ref name="qingshi">{{cite journal|title=雍正繼位之謎研究|year=2010}}</ref> The Yongzheng Emperor subsequently purged his brothers in succession, renaming [[Yinsi]] and [[Yintang]] to "Akina" and "Seshe" (阿其那, 塞思黑) respectively and imprisoning them until their deaths.
